<p>1) Said plot holes covered. I am, however, purposely not covering the possibility of the subject disintegrating in front of someone. I think it would be interesting for him to die in front of someone.</p>
<p>2) And just for clarification I'm assuming more like solo field agents rather than an MTF squad. As noted, the agent has one hour to relieve themselves of the backpack or they become victims of it themselves. While a pair of agents would work (so they could trade off possession of the backpack), I'm not sure they would use an MTF to recover a mere backpack, especially considering how overt it would be.</p>
<p>3) As I've noted: The 400-word limit sucks. I agree that there are areas that need to be expanded on, but it's getting difficult to allow for every possible contingency that gets brought up. I'm honestly debating doing up a sandbox entry and offering that when needed.</p>

