<p>I think just making the creature's appearance a blur is a little underwhelming. It could work, but adding some imaginative details and descriptions to a 4 dimensional being could add a lot to the article. For instance, giving it really strange bodily proportions, anomalous anatomy, or maybe the blur is the only part our human minds can comprehend, with the rest being too strange/incomprehensible. Perhaps it appears as a blur from a medium to long distance, but up close you can see some of its true features?</p>

